{"server":"tw","storyId":"act26side_level_act26side_06_beg","groupId":"act26side","stageId":"act26side_06","title":"夜半歌聲","storyCode":"HE-6","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act26side/level_act26side_06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"467cba8e4637ef020d8a3085fd15915d88477aa6ed7875c21ba3fea93c0eb800","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都檢查過了，屋內沒有打鬥的跡象，兩個孩子沒被吵醒，都還在睡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫曼不可能會傷害孩子們，這點你可以放心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是暫時還沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我並不確定她的理智能夠保持多長時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......多謝你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等孩子們醒了，你打算怎麼告訴他們赫曼的事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們有權知情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有的事不知道或許更好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是否可以理解為，你在向我提出建議？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，費德里科......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，你不介意我這麼喊吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放過赫曼的是你，得到孩子們信賴的也是你，所以決定權在你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感覺有點沉重？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有佩戴負重裝備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就當這是你的幽默感了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在看什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你認識這個嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......被褥的碎布？不少居民都用這種布做冬天的被褥，不過這種花紋倒是頭一次見到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是拉特蘭常見的花紋。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"破碎的布料下方，雙胞胎的鼻息綿長安穩。\n執行者近乎凝視地看了一會，才將視線轉向一旁簡陋的木桌上。\n那裡擺著一只陶土小瓶。\n插在瓶內，尚未完全枯萎的淺色花束，是室內除了孩子們之外唯一的色彩。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......花？不太新鮮了，應該是這兩天都沒有更換。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是赫曼本人的興趣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......不確定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我原以為我對這些跟著我的人足夠瞭解。但我甚至不能確定......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要立刻回一趟聖堂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於薩卡茲相關的問題，已知的情報已經足夠做出判斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，你的判斷是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首先我需要瞭解一件事——你是否與奧倫·亞吉奧拉斯有所交流？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位奧倫特使？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有多少交流。他來這沒多久就失蹤了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瞭解了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你自稱杰拉爾德，但這不是你的真名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......一個被使用了十年的名字，誰能說它不是真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們在這裡過日子，從用那些破木板在這裡搭起第一間屋子開始，我就只是荒野獵戶杰拉爾德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的自我認知與我無關。你可以是杰拉爾德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"古怪的急迫感驅使著語言自口腔滑落。\n費德里科沒有給對方說話的空間。\n他張口說出了那個已經十年沒有再被正式提起過的名字。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡茲戴爾內戰中嶄露頭角的雇傭兵，中庭公證所通緝的在逃人員之一，共有三十二項被記錄的罪名，曾滅殺教皇廳旗下三支執行小隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"霍斯特·蒂芬達爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我知道。而我可以查到的資訊，其他人也一樣可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這會是最後一次警告——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰拉爾德，你的身份已經不是秘密。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老練的拉特蘭特勤隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_366_1","isRemote":false,"text":"確認前方建築，是目標地點無誤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老練的拉特蘭特勤隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_366_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的會有薩卡茲願意住在我們的修道院裡嗎？真難想像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的拉特蘭特勤隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_371_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要準備行動了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老練的拉特蘭特勤隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_366_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不著急。等長官們的指令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老練的拉特蘭特勤隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_366_1","isRemote":false,"text":"繼續觀察吧。總歸我們的人已經把這一帶都圍上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老練的拉特蘭特勤隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_366_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像之前抓到的那個薩卡茲小隊一樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老練的拉特蘭特勤隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_366_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要是薩卡茲，就一個都別想跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的拉特蘭特勤隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_371_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g9_monasteryroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我拿了吃的回來。能找到的東西不多，稍微吃一點？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，斯普莉雅......我沒有胃口......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，我先放這，沒准一會你就感覺餓了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你，斯普莉雅......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又謝我什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也沒什麼，就是想......謝你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想謝我的話，就把這些東西吃掉，然後快點睡覺吧！這樣的話我也可以早點下班，多好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是這樣嗎？那我現在就睡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，我睡不著......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"猜到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一直留在這裡不要緊嗎？我現在已經好多了，所以，呃，我的意思是......你不用特地留下陪我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看住你是我的工作，好姑娘，別把我想得那麼體貼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你放心，我不會逃走的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可說不定，越是看起來乖的小姑娘，往往越要小心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道你頭上那對黑色的角意味著什麼嗎？你知道按你現在的狀態，被帶回拉特蘭之後會面對什麼樣的處境嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你當然不會知道啦。你現在都沒法和我共感了，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別做出那種表情嘛，剛剛是嚇唬你的，教宗閣下脾氣很好，別太擔心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有擔心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管會受什麼樣的懲罰，都是我應得的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼聲音？有人在外面......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管外面發生什麼，都與你無關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乖乖待在這，我去看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g11_monasterycorridor_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪了，沒人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"才這麼一段時間不見，你的警覺度就已經低到這個程度了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖。你這傢伙說話還是這麼讓人討厭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真懷疑你當時在維多利亞是怎麼幹活的，該不會淨給拉特蘭在外頭結仇了吧，奧倫？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這可就冤枉我了，明明我才是最兢兢業業的那一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說到工作，你那邊應該已經準備好了吧，斯普莉雅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不太喜歡兜圈子，給我一個肯定的回覆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼意外的話，天亮前就動手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g9_monasteryroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（奇怪......斯普莉雅怎麼還沒回來？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（外面沒有動靜了......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（什、什麼聲音？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯普莉雅......？是你嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呀......唔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"壓低的男聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"噓，別出聲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊蒙德？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我走，福爾圖娜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g5_gatheringplace_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"終於出來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼你會在這，蕾繆安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出了一點小狀況。被一個討厭的傢伙攔住，還被他給逃走了......唉，這麼說出來感覺更丟人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為聽到從這附近傳來了一點動靜，就趕過來看了看......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有點沒想到呢，費德里科你會說出這樣威脅的話來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"威脅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊呀？難道不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你剛剛說的那些，是什麼意思......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是說出實情。正確的判斷建立在知曉真實現狀的基礎之上，我沒有威脅誰的必要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......你的想法我姑且可以理解啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，人可是最難以預測的生物，很多時候連我們自己都會搞不清楚自己的想法，行動和想法完全不是一回事的情況也不少見......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根據我的經驗，事情往往不會按照“最合理”的方向發展呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個話題先放一邊......看來目前的情況比我想像的要複雜不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來吧，費德里科，我們需要交換情報。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g5_gatheringplace_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的意思是，我們看到的那個怪物，就是那名叫作赫曼的失蹤的薩卡茲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看到她時她的狀態，和我面對她的時候聽起來還有所不同。如果是這樣的話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"失去正常的生理形態，從無法交流、喪失理智，表現出明顯的進食欲望的狀態，轉變為殘留少量理智，能夠開口溝通的狀態。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"進化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以暫時這樣推測。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的身上發生了某種轉化，我曾在執行一項有關伊比利亞的任務中查閱過相關資料，有一個教會組織在海岸線附近頻繁活動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"深海教會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很瞭解呢，費德里科。你在之前的任務裡也見過類似的生物嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那也是見過，這樣說起來就方便多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前有點在意那邊的事情，所以稍微瞭解過一些......關於那個教會，我們之後或許會和伊比利亞那邊的審判庭合作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教宗閣下最近也在頭痛這件事，沒想到竟然會在這裡碰上......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好處理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的哦，很棘手，也很危險......剛剛攔住我的那一個，如果不是對方主動退開的話，我應該贏不了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓人有點火大......看來還是得更快一點恢復到過去的水準才行。不然的話，別說那個笑眯眯的教士了，就連斯普莉雅也敢小瞧我了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說到這個，費德里科，你把這些都告訴那位杰拉爾德先生真的好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他有知情的權利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，你決定就好。現在你準備怎麼做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"查一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"火不會自己點燃。聖堂的失火有古怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有花......不，還不能確定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首先，我需要找到那些助燃物。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，這個點突然把你們喊起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謹慎的薩卡茲居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還好，有不少人本來就睡不著，一喊就起來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謹慎的薩卡茲居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人我都通知到了，杰拉爾德，我們隨時能出發。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謹慎的薩卡茲居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過......你之前不是還說要等到早上再走？怎麼忽然改變主意了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謹慎的薩卡茲居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是因為那場火......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謹慎的薩卡茲居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰拉爾德，我可以保證，這事絕對不是萊蒙德那小子幹的，所以我們沒必要這麼急匆匆地——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我不懷疑他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謹慎的薩卡茲居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有突發情況。這個之後再解釋，總之，我們等不到早上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前出去的隊伍還沒有消息？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謹慎的薩卡茲居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，很不對勁，我怕他們是遇上了什麼麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謹慎的薩卡茲居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼辦，杰拉爾德，需要我再帶幾個人一起出去探路嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不用，我們一起走，到時候提醒其他人跟緊隊伍，任何人都不要落單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在前面探路，讓那幾個老傢伙跟著我一起。你帶著萊蒙德守住後方，沒問題吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謹慎的薩卡茲居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......有問題。你的態度不對勁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謹慎的薩卡茲居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到底出了什麼事？杰拉爾德，你在緊張，因為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謹慎的薩卡茲居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是因為那些拉特蘭人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......瞞不過你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還是那麼謹慎，里德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謹慎的薩卡茲居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打住。我現在不叫那個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我只是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"杰拉爾德沒能把話說下去。\n他意識到為什麼這位老夥計能一眼看出自己的狀態不對，他意識到，他正下意識將一隻手按在藏在腰間的匕首上。\n他正逐漸從獵戶杰拉爾德變回那個雇傭兵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我的錯。剛剛的氣氛......太像之前我們還在卡茲戴爾那時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不確定這是不是我多心，但我現在的感覺很不好。老夥計，你可以把這當作是我的直覺，我們該儘快離開。越快越好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對，越快越好。你帶著準備好的人先走，立刻就出發。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謹慎的薩卡茲居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是那句話。你是頭兒，都聽你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謹慎的薩卡茲居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過提醒一句，上一次你的直覺是我們能找到一個好地方，拋下過去好好過日子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們會找到的，我發誓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謹慎的薩卡茲居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我信你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謹慎的薩卡茲居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上一次你也確實帶著我們找到這裡了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但願能順利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，愛琳，這次沒法帶你一起走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你會怪我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你還在，看到現在的光景，你又會怎麼想......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是誰？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是我，杰拉爾德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你在忙嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有件事情，我想或許應該告訴你......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g1_monasteryentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，老人家還真是有壓迫感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是的......只是來出個任務，我也不想搞成這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又是薩卡茲，又是墮天，現在還要加上一個發瘋的主教。真是饒了我吧，這地方的水未免也太深了一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"偏偏被一起派來的還是費德里科......嗯，該說是好還是壞呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以防萬一......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奧倫，是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是不是快要動手了？現在你那裡應該有人手吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我建議你最好查一查這個叫斯特凡諾的主教，我覺得他不太對勁，搞不好還有點危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直覺？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能算是吧......這座修道院給我的感覺不怎麼好，唉，也不能這麼說，就是因為還算不錯，所以才不太好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在這的時間比我久，難道沒有這種感覺？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說，怎麼會有這種所有人都挺努力，但卻偏偏沒什麼希望的地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這也太讓人難受了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事情就是這樣......我沒想到萊蒙德還不知道這個消息，就把德爾菲娜和福爾圖娜的事情告訴他了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他看起來很激動，說實話，我有點擔心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......還好嗎？杰拉爾德？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我沒事。別擔心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是你的問題，是我沒來得及找機會告訴他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊蒙德人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他問了我福爾圖娜的事，然後就衝出去了。我聽到他說要去把福爾圖娜帶回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"福爾圖娜那裡應該有拉特蘭的使者守著，真的不要緊嗎......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......薩科塔不可能允許他這麼幹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊蒙德他出生在這裡，這裡和外面不同。他對我們和薩科塔之間的關係還是不夠瞭解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得你說過，薩科塔和薩卡茲的關係......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很糟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我們真的只是平民，或許還不會糟到這個地步......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那萊蒙德現在豈不是很危險？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我現在去找他。多謝你告訴我這些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能做的事情很少......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰拉爾德，現在我開始覺得你的決定是正確的，你們該早點離開這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對，立刻就離開，這是明智的選擇，不要......不要等明天......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我確實有這個打算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克萊芒，你的臉色不太好......是不是還發生了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很好。我只是有點......今天發生了太多事，我有點，不好受......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，杰拉爾德，你說得對，我們不是一路，別再留在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你現在的狀態很不好，克萊芒，冷靜一點。你——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謹慎的薩卡茲居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好了，頭兒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謹慎的薩卡茲居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們按照你說的，準備從之前探路隊出發的反方向出發，但我在前面發現了一支部隊正在朝修道院的方向靠近！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說......部隊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謹慎的薩卡茲居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是拉特蘭人！有薩科塔，還有穿著戍衛隊制服的傢伙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謹慎的薩卡茲居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們當年和那群混帳幹過多少仗，我再熟不過，錯不了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謹慎的薩卡茲居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們很快就會被包圍......哈哈，杰拉爾德，你聽到了嗎？我們很快就會被包圍！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謹慎的薩卡茲居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們從一開始就沒打算放過我們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"杰拉爾德猛地縮了縮手指。\n幾息之後，他才察覺是自己的指尖太過冰冷了，襯得套著匕首的皮革反而都像是在發熱一樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克萊芒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在。杰拉爾德，現在該怎麼辦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別擔心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我逃了太久，現在只不過是讓一切重新回到正軌......事情很快就會解決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謹慎的薩卡茲居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"頭兒，要怎麼幹，你說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謹慎的薩卡茲居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大夥心裡都有這個準備，隨時能動手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼些年，也辛苦你們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謹慎的薩卡茲居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要做什麼？杰拉爾德，你要做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你別衝動，先把匕首放下......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很冷靜，克萊芒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"薩卡茲深深地吐氣，更加用力握住匕首，雪亮的刀刃緩緩自鞘中被拔出。\n實在是太燙了。\n有一瞬間，杰拉爾德幾乎快要抓不穩自己的老夥計。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這十年來，我從未如今天一般清醒過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果只有鮮血能讓這一切結束，那麼我所能做的事就只剩下這麼一件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別為此擔憂，薩卡茲的血不會白白流淌。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
